  "meta": {
    "name": "Brass & Crystal v1",
    "author": "@eta",
    "notes": [
      "Authoritative Sprint 1 palette; token IDs are stable and will not be renamed in Sprint 1.",
      "ui.text.primary (#E6EDF6) on ui.panel.bg (#1F222A) achieves contrast >= 4.5:1 (approx ~12:1).",
      "ui.text.invert (#0C0F12) on ui.frame.brass (#B88533) achieves contrast >= 7:1 (approx ~10:1).",
      "Gauge fills vs backs meet >= 3:1 contrast: health ~4:1, stamina ~4.5:1 (approx).",
      "Health gauge uses warm amber-red; stamina uses cool teal; avoids pure red/green for color-blind friendliness.",
      "Minimap colors provide clear, small-size reads on minimap.bg (#0C0D10); ore is distinct from corridor and room.",
      "Ore spark tokens are targeted ~12–18% luminance above terrain.rock.highlight (#585866) to ensure in-world readability.",
      "Lamp warm (#F2B45A) and crystal cool (#4FD8E0) align with biome-crystal-caverns lighting references.",
      "Designed and tuned for 3×–4× render scale with dark UI panels; edges and highlights avoid pure white clipping.",
      "Strict JSON (UTF-8). Consumed by src/ui/theme-loader.js -> Map getColor/resolveTint; missing tokens log once under visual.palette.missing.",
      "Phaser usage: sprite setTint, UI Graphics fillStyle, and future shader uniforms."
    ]
  }
